{"branch":"오산대역점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">오산대역점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-bef1db03d3fd58ae.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"오산대역점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-bef1db03d3fd58ae.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>경기 오산시 내삼미로 85 우정프라자 201호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 1호선</span><span>오산대역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>스마트시티센터앞</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>스마트시티센터앞</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>오산대역엘크루.쌍용예가</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>오산대역후문</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>오산대역후문</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>매홀중학교</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>매홀중학교</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">8</span><span>쌍용예가.오산대역엘크루</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">광역</span></dt><dd><span>M5532</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">일반</span></dt><dd><span>201</span><span>32</span><span>8</span><span>C1</span><span>C2</span><span>60</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">직행</span></dt><dd><span>5200</span><span>8302</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">시외</span></dt><dd><span>8135</span></dd></div><div><dt><span clas